flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> OPEN[Open Web Portal]
    OPEN --> PORTAL[/Select Institute Portal/]
    PORTAL --> ACCOUNT{Already Have an Account?}
    ACCOUNT -->|Yes| LOGIN[/Enter Email and Password/]
    ACCOUNT -->|No| REGISTER[/Complete Student Registration Form/]
    REGISTER --> REGVALID{Registration Details Valid and Email Available?}
    REGVALID -->|No| REGERROR[Show Registration Validation Error]
    REGERROR -->|Retry| REGISTER
    REGVALID -->|Yes| CREATE[Create Student Account and Show Confirmation]
    CREATE -->|Return to Login| LOGIN
    LOGIN --> VALID{Credentials, Active Account, Student Role, and Institute Access Valid?}
    VALID -->|No| ERROR[Show Access Error]
    ERROR -->|Retry| LOGIN
    VALID -->|Yes| SESSION[Create Student Session]
    SESSION --> DASH[Open Student Dashboard]
    DASH --> END([Access Complete])
